post.description:
The stored keys are checked again: still good, the gateway is active;
otherwise it is `failed` with `last_error`, and the club can check it
again or paste new keys. 404 NO_GATEWAY, 409 NOT_DISABLED.

get.description:
Null below 5 responses with comments (and no call). The kept summary
while the number of responses is the same (`cached: true`); a new one,
counted as an action, once it changes.

The certificate's PDF -- the very file its holder downloads -- while
it is valid, by its public id (the page a holder shares) or its number;
404 for anything else, revoked or not found alike. Never by a ticket id.
